<title>ITALY: MOTORCYCLING-SAN MARINO SUPERBIKE GP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-SAN MARINO SUPERBIKE GP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MISANO ADRIATICO, Italy 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the</p>
<p>San Marino Superbike Grand Prix on Sunday:</p>
<p>Race 1 (25 laps, 93.38 km)</p>
<p> 1. Pierfrancesco Chili (Italy) Ducati 48 minutes 44.232 seconds</p>
<p> 2. John Kocinski (U.S.) Honda	   48:58.426</p>
<p> 3. Carl Fogarty (Britain) Ducati	49:48.354</p>
<p> 4. Aaron Slight (New Zealand) Honda   50.03.269</p>
<p>Race 2</p>
<p> 1. Kocinski				   47:44.390</p>
<p> 2. Slight				     48:16.253</p>
<p> 3. Fogarty				    48:24.933</p>
<p> 4. Neil Hodgson (Britain) Ducati	48:31.885</p>
<p>Leading standings (after two Grands Prix):</p>
<p> 1. Kocinski				    79 points</p>
<p> 2. Fogarty				     65</p>
<p> 3. Slight					58</p>
<p> 4. Simon Crafar (New Zealand) Kawasaki 52</p>
<p> 5. Colin Edwards (U.S.) Yamaha	   38</p>
<p> 6. Scott Russell (U.S.) Yamaha	   29</p>
<p> 7. Chili					 25</p>
<p> 8. Akira Yanagawa (Japan) Kawasaki     24</p>
